blurb: The board addressed community backlash over a $12,000 compensation package
  for an administrator amidst a year of significant budget cuts and staff reductions.
  The meeting also included reports on school activities, the first read of a new
  bell-to-bell cell phone policy, and passionate public commentary on district priorities
  and staff morale.
